        "title": "Finest temple of Lord Shiva",
        "text": "Had great experience to visit Kathmandu. If you are planning to visit Nepal plan for atleast 4-5 days. Apart from Kathmandu there are several nearby places to visit like Bhaktapur city, Pokhra. In Kathmandu you should visit Pashupatinath Temple, Shanga, Syambunath Temple, Bodhnath Stupa.\nPokhra is a very beautiful place. People must go there and see snowy white Mount Everest valley from there. You can enjoy various adventurous sports there.\nTo begin your journey by road or train first reach Gorakhpur in India. From there you can hire a taxi or bus to Sanauli border. It will took 2 hours to reach border. Then from border you can hire a cab or bus to reach on top to Kathmandu. It will took around 10 hours. Roads are really very bad so carry your scalf to get rid of dust. On border only you can exchange your currency into nepal rupess. 100 Indian Rupee is equal to 160 Nepalese. Do bargain while buying things.\n",
