        "title": "A Must see!!!",
        "text": "In Varanassi India we saw the raw deal.\nHere we were on the other side of the river and had a excellent view of all the happenings at this crematorium! What a privilege!\nIt is respectful, and done with dignity!\nWe sat there for more than an hour and experience the Hindu way of cremation! We had an excellent guide which told us exactly what was happening and why. The temple itself could only be seen from the outside( only for Hindus) - but was beautiful!\nNot to be missed at all!",
